{"id":"bcf5e4a644e3e929","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-df-unitary.md","title":"Unitary Operator","display":"df-unitary — Unitary Operator","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-unitary","aliases":["58-df-unitary","58-df-unitary-operator","Unitary Operator","Unitary Matrix"],"display":"df-unitary — Unitary Operator","depends_on":["[[../batch13/58-df-hilbert-space.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[58-df-surjective.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-unitary"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-unitary</span><span>58-df-unitary-operator</span><span>Unitary Operator</span><span>Unitary Matrix</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-unitary — Unitary Operator"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b70ce791d5b1a19b\" href=\"?note=b70ce791d5b1a19b\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-hilbert-space.md\">../batch13/58-df-hilbert-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9f8cb046321ba311\" href=\"?note=9f8cb046321ba311\" title=\"58-df-surjective.md\">58-df-surjective.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U,H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle\\in V\">\\(U,H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b70ce791d5b1a19b\" href=\"?note=b70ce791d5b1a19b\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-hilbert-space.md\">../batch13/58-df-hilbert-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Surjective}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Surjective}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"9f8cb046321ba311\" href=\"?note=9f8cb046321ba311\" title=\"58-df-surjective.md\">58-df-surjective.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Unitary}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Unitary}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}unitary}\\vdash\\mathrm{Unitary}_S(U,H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(U,H,H)\\land\\mathrm{Surjective}(U,H,H)\\land\\forall x,y\\in H\\;\\bigl(\\langle U(x),U(y)\\rangle=\\langle x,y\\rangle\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}unitary}\\vdash\\mathrm{Unitary}_S(U,H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(U,H,H)\\land\\mathrm{Surjective}(U,H,H)\\land\\forall x,y\\in H\\;\\bigl(\\langle U(x),U(y)\\rangle=\\langle x,y\\rangle\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Unitary: preserves inner product</li>\n<li>Equivalent characterizations include inner-product preservation and norm preservation.</li>\n<li>Isometry: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\|Ux\\| = \\|x\\|\">\\(\\|Ux\\| = \\|x\\|\\)</span></li>\n<li>Unitary = isometric + surjective</li>\n<li>Spectrum lies on unit circle</li>\n<li>Unitary group <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U(n)\">\\(U(n)\\)</span>: all <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n \\times n\">\\(n \\times n\\)</span> unitary matrices</li>\n<li>Stone's theorem identifies strongly continuous one-parameter unitary groups with self-adjoint infinitesimal generators.</li>\n<li><code>58-df-unitary-operator</code> is merged here; both files defined unitary operators on Hilbert spaces by the adjoint identities.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Reed and Simon, Functional Analysis</li>\n<li>Rudin, Functional Analysis</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch13/58-df-hilbert-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"b70ce791d5b1a19b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-hilbert-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-surjective.md","status":"resolved","id":"9f8cb046321ba311","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-surjective.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-hilbert-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"b70ce791d5b1a19b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch13/58-df-hilbert-space.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-surjective.md","status":"resolved","id":"9f8cb046321ba311","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Surjective}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-surjective.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"U,H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Surjective}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Unitary}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}unitary}\\vdash\\mathrm{Unitary}_S(U,H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(U,H,H)\\land\\mathrm{Surjective}(U,H,H)\\land\\forall x,y\\in H\\;\\bigl(\\langle U(x),U(y)\\rangle=\\langle x,y\\rangle\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\|Ux\\| = \\|x\\|","display":false},{"tex":"U(n)","display":false},{"tex":"n \\times n","display":false}],"bytes":1652,"backlinks":[{"id":"6408ad949910b0f7","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"a11585cba9c21cfd","anchor":"ref-292","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[58-df-unitary]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1353","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-unitary.md|58-df-unitary]]（batch05）"}],"outgoing":["b70ce791d5b1a19b","36d7463d215be751","9f8cb046321ba311"]}